name: mule_large_transfers
description: "DEMO 2b — The ring without the noise: the same transfer graph narrowed by a saved predicate to AMOUNT ≥ 5 000. Ordinary transfers are a long tail under 3 000, so only the hub → relay wires, the relay → offshore crypto legs and the shell loop survive; the smurf deposits (each under 1 000) vanish — which is exactly what structuring is designed to do, so compare with DEMO 2. Cycles finds the shell loop; Shortest path from SMURF-01 to OFFSHORE-77 on the unfiltered view shows the three-hop layering chain."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: dagre
profile: finance
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: mule_transfers_dataset
    sourceCol: PAYER_ACCOUNT
    targetCol: PAYEE_ACCOUNT
    linkKindCol: CHANNEL
    attrCols[3]: BOOKED_AT,AMOUNT,PAYEE_COUNTRY
  filter:
    kind: group
    op: AND
    items[1]{kind,field,operator,value}:
      condition,AMOUNT,">=","5000"
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
